        :rulingDate "2010-08-15"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """The mana value of the revealed card is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
